{
  "rules": {
    ".read": false,
    ".write": false,

    "//": [
      "Realtime Database rules for Bodime. Paste these into",
      "Firebase console -> Realtime Database -> Rules, or deploy with",
      "  firebase deploy --only database",
      "",
      "The app has no server and no Firebase Auth, so these rules cannot tell",
      "one visitor from another. What they do enforce:",
      "  * no node is listable - you can only read a house if you already know",
      "    its exact path, and that path is a hash of the house name AND the",
      "    house password (see housePath() in index.html)",
      "  * a house node can never be deleted wholesale",
      "  * a password can never be written in the clear again",
      "  * the old, guessable houses/<name> path is read-only apart from the",
      "    one-way tombstone the app writes after moving a house off it",
      "",
      "Apply these only after every device has opened the updated app at least",
      "once, so that each house has been migrated to its private path.",
      "For a genuinely private database, add Firebase Anonymous Auth and gate",
      "reads on request.auth != null as a follow-up."
    ],

    "h": {
      "$house": {
        ".read": true,
        ".write": "newData.exists()",

        "meta": {
          ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['house', 'passHash', 'passSalt'])",
          "house":    { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 120" },
          "passHash": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().matches(/^[0-9a-f]{64}$/)" },
          "passSalt": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().matches(/^[0-9a-f]{8,64}$/)" },
          "lang":     { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 8" },
          "pass":     { ".validate": false },
          "$other":   { ".validate": false }
        },

        "members":  { "$id": { "id": { ".validate": "newData.val() === $id" } } },
        "expenses": { "$id": { "id": { ".validate": "newData.val() === $id" } } },
        "settles":  { "$id": { "id": { ".validate": "newData.val() === $id" } } },
        "archives": { "$id": { "id": { ".validate": "newData.val() === $id" } } },
        "activity": { "$id": { "id": { ".validate": "newData.val() === $id" } } },
        "debts":    { "$id": { "id": { ".validate": "newData.val() === $id" } } },
        "recurring":{ "$id": { "id": { ".validate": "newData.val() === $id" } } },

        "tombs": { "$coll": { "$id": { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" } } },

        "$other": { ".validate": false }
      }
    },

    "names": {
      "$name": {
        ".read": true,
        ".write": "!data.exists()",
        ".validate": "newData.hasChild('at')",
        "at":     { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" },
        "$other": { ".validate": false }
      }
    },

    "houses": {
      "$name": {
        ".read": true,
        ".write": "data.exists() && !data.hasChild('moved') && newData.child('moved').val() === 1",
        ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['moved'])"
      }
    }
  }
}
